Thunder Bolt is an independent PHP implementation inspired by Slack Bolt for
JavaScript. It is not an official Slack SDK or an endorsed Slack product.

Generated declarations and method bindings derive from slackapi/bolt-js and
slackapi/node-slack-sdk, both distributed under the MIT license. Original
copyright notices and licenses are preserved under docs/research/reference/.
The exact upstream versions, source locations, and hashes are recorded in
docs/research/upstream-manifest.json and the API inventories.

The shell completion stubs are adapted from Tempest 3.20.0's console package.
Its copyright notice and MIT license are preserved under
docs/research/reference/tempest/LICENSE.md. Other dependency licenses remain
in vendor/ when installed with Composer.
